- [x] **CD-006:** Use Docker Buildx with registry-backed layer caching and build
  `linux/amd64` plus `linux/arm64` when dependency compatibility is verified.
  - Acceptance:
    - Pull-request CI includes an ARM64 dry-run build that proves both images
