  - Files: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, `.github/workflows/publish-images.yml`,
    docs.
  - Complexity: medium.
  - Recommended order: after CD-007 so the reusable quality workflow can host
    the ARM64 dry-run.

- [x] **CD-007:** Make publication depend on successful lint, type checking,
  tests, package builds, and image smoke tests for the exact release commit.
  - Acceptance:
    - Quality checks are extracted into a reusable workflow
      `.github/workflows/_quality.yml`.
    - `ci.yml` calls the reusable workflow for pull requests and pushes.
    - `publish-images.yml` runs the reusable workflow on the exact release SHA
      and makes `build-and-scan` depend on it.
    - No release tag can be promoted until the full quality suite passes.
  - Files: `.github/workflows/_quality.yml`, `ci.yml`, `publish-images.yml`,
    docs.
  - Complexity: medium.

- [x] **CD-008:** Pull each published digest from GHCR and verify its
  `/health/ready` endpoint before considering the release successful.

