## Definition of done

Every completed item must include:

- implementation and focused tests;
- applicable lint, formatting, type, unit, and integration checks;
- updated user/deployment documentation;
- CI evidence for the affected packages and both engines when relevant;
- no embedded credentials or broader permissions than the task requires.

Changes affecting both engines must preserve the shared core contract and keep
  the images independently deployable.
